{"id":"cecotec-sandwich-croque-monsieur-en-cecofry","sourceUrl":"https://cecotec.es/recetas/cecofry/sandwich-croque-monsieur-en-cecofry","publishedAt":"2025-06-09T13:41:46+02:00","name":{"es":"Sandwich Croque Monsieur","en":"Croque Monsieur"},"description":{"es":"","en":""},"appliances":["cecofry"],"course":"snack","tags":["cecofry","snack"],"baseServings":2,"servingsMax":null,"servingsUnit":"comensales","servingsText":"2","minutes":15,"minutesSource":"cecotec","timeBucket":"le15","difficulty":"easy","difficultySource":"cecotec","kcalPerServing":null,"photoUrl":"/ideas/photos/cecotec-sandwich-croque-monsieur-en-cecofry.jpg","cookedCount":0,"ingredients":[{"ingredientId":"queso-rallado","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Queso rallado"},{"ingredientId":"loncha-de-jamon-de-york","quantity":4,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"4 lonchas de jamón de york"},{"ingredientId":"loncha-de-queso","quantity":4,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"4 lonchas de queso"},{"ingredientId":"rebanada-de-pan-de-molde","quantity":4,"unit":"ud","toTaste":false,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"4 rebanadas de pan de molde"},{"ingredientId":"bechamel","quantity":null,"unit":null,"toTaste":true,"optional":false,"group":null,"note":null,"sourceText":"Bechamel"}],"steps":[{"text":{"es":"Introducimos dos rebanadas de pan en la Cecofry, añadimos una cucharada de bechamel y la untamos, rellenamos cada una con dos lonchas de jamón de york y dos de queso.","en":"Put two slices of bread in the Cecofry, add a tablespoon of béchamel and spread it, then fill each one with two slices of ham and two of cheese."}},{"text":{"es":"Cerramos con las otras rebanadas de pan y untamos la superficie con más bechamel, espolvoreamos con queso rallado y programamos 180ºC durante 12 minutos.","en":"Close with the other slices of bread and